#  Autonomous Campus Security System (Arduino)

##  Description

This repository contains my undergraduate thesis on designing a low-cost autonomous security system using Arduino to improve campus safety.

##  Thesis

You can read the full thesis here:
👉 [Download Thesis](Autonomous_Campus_Security_System.pdf)

##  Objective

To detect motion and alert users in case of intrusion using sensors and an alarm system.

##  Tools & Technologies

* Arduino
* Embedded Systems
* Sensors (PIR, Ultrasonic)

##  Author

Armand Bukama
